{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new job at Red Rock Market! Collect shopping carts, ignore customers, and complete To-Do lists that encourage mischief and mayhem. Fight a chicken mascot, prevent an alien invasion, learn to breakdance, crash a forklift, and more. How much can you get away with and still keep your job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/b61ea20a9dc5636e7a2261a1a1d6ef0f.webp?t=1770220156\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/7180051aa75461a781355b253794ca1b.webp?t=1770220156\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/7180051aa75461a781355b253794ca1b.poster.avif?t=1770220156\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working with the public is stressful, but your coworkers have come up with fun ways to relax on break. Grow your reputation and they'll invite you to join them. Invest the money you earn on the job in your new found passions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/2a05595db76049a83ac4f2a6f39f92f1.webp?t=1770220156\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/b3093e44e205fd15dc49dc1cf0f85461.webp?t=1770220156\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/b3093e44e205fd15dc49dc1cf0f85461.poster.avif?t=1770220156\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid actual work and track your exploits with To-Do lists of fun challenges. Already played a game of rotten fruit baseball? Check that one off, and figure out how to hide from customers in the soda can display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/72208cd6bd4153a86127b6377e1e0b8e.webp?t=1770220156\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/00f57f06a94a167a54c4fafa9b626dc9.webp?t=1770220156\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/00f57f06a94a167a54c4fafa9b626dc9.poster.avif?t=1770220156\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive skill tree provides plenty of options for new abilities and upgrades. Learn to breakdance, drive a forklift, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/69e896ddc6998bb5b81a88e359e5b0a8.webp?t=1770220156\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/83043c2b45ce7d6568838a270abc4ced.webp?t=1770220156\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/83043c2b45ce7d6568838a270abc4ced.poster.avif?t=1770220156\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fellow associates are an odd bunch, but they mean well. Chat with them on break, and you never know what you might learn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree with lots of depth. Learn to breakdance, improve your golf swing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret mini-games to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help out in other departments like Receiving, Bakery, and Deli.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678260?t=1770220156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/7182b1640a24bce027481b9e3e535593bc38ba09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770220156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/cbbb724858cf58fbc8403f95d083863be7c0dacb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770220156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/cbbb724858cf58fbc8403f95d083863be7c0dacb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770220156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new job at Red Rock Market! Collect shopping carts, ignore customers, and complete To-Do lists that encourage mischief and mayhem. Fight a chicken mascot, prevent an alien invasion, learn to breakdance, crash a forklift, and more. How much can you get away with and still 